# refiner v4_3 student (docs/refiner_v4/V4_3_SPEC.md, user decisions 2026-10-16 KST; ARM=v4_3): BEV KD stays on (yaml
# default = the ck2e2e_bevkd setting) and
#   * readout 'range' (M4): B / U blocked-field logits + margin D per unique parent, read at each candidate's EXECUTED
#     states (exec_model lqr = the official tracker port), 20 bins of 0.25 s, EP head on the detached evidence, P_ref
#     scene query, corridor version 2;
#   * Phase 0b R2 (spec 'Phase 0b' / 'Phase 1c'): rg_read any4 (B / U read as the OR of the 2 x 2 cells around each
#     executed point) + rg_stopped_aware (B = the stopped-aware B that NC reads, + a Bp group = the plain not-behind B
#     that TTC reads below the 2 m switch) -- the representation of the R2 teachers v4T10_rng2 / v4M10_rng2
#     (tools/ck/v4/run_teachers.sh READOUT=range R2=1); the computed edits read the fields the same way;
#   * computed edits (M5): the rule edits of the critic's top-8 parents on the predicted fields, EXTRA candidates only
#     (never a gate; selection over 96 + 8); recorded with the 96 and labelled by labeler2 (critic BCE on their
#     official labels); corrector A off (its zero-init residual on the edit is the optional next step);
#   * KD routing (M6): score KD on nc (<- DET) and dac (<- MAP) only, on the parent columns (kd_parent_only as v4_arm),
#     scope 'all' ('near' = option); constraint KD: DET blocked field B BCE (spec M6 / user decision: occ_channels=B,
#     here the stopped-aware B of the R2 pair; occ_channels=BBp also distils the Bp group that the student's TTC reads,
#     BU / all the U channel -- options the user has not confirmed) + MAP margin Huber (s <= 32 m) on the student's
#     unique parents of the KD set.
# Teachers: the R2 RANGE teachers v4T10_rng2 (DET) / v4M10_rng2 (MAP) below (not trained yet: launch_util2 refuses a
# launch until the runs exist and have finished); the two KD calibration paths are PLACEHOLDERS -- launch_util2 refuses
# a launch until an E2E_CK_SET file sets kd_calib.det / kd_calib.map (KD calibration of the R2 teachers on nc / dac,
# fit_kd_calib(_family).py) or kd_calib.enabled=false.  kd_constraint also refuses teachers on another grid (corridor
# version / time bins) or with another rg_stopped_aware than the student (an R1 teacher for this R2 student); rg_read is
# recorded per side and may differ (the R2 pair has any4 like this arm).
# Not trained without the user's approval (GPUs 0-3 only); the Phase 1c decision (P1) gates this run.
# The v4.exec_model .. v4.kd_constraint / v4.rg_* keys are OPTIONAL v4 keys (online2._d_v4_opt; launch_util2.apply_sets2
# declares them), absent from ck_e2e2.yaml so the older arms are unchanged.
v4.readout=range
v4.exec_model=lqr
v4.ev_tbins=20
v4.ev_tbin_s=0.25
v4.ep_evidence=true
v4.pref_head=true
v4.corridor_version=2
v4.rg_read=any4
v4.rg_stopped_aware=true
v4.edits=computed
v4.edit_k=8
v4.corrector=false
v4.kd_parent_only=true
kd_score_keys=[nc,dac]
v4.kd_score_scope=all
v4.kd_constraint.enabled=true
v4.kd_constraint.lambda_occ=0.5
v4.kd_constraint.lambda_margin=0.5
v4.kd_constraint.map_range_m=32.0
v4.kd_constraint.occ_channels=B
teacher_det_run=/home/external-user/ssd/yongjae_refiner/ck/v4/train/v4T10_rng2
teacher_map_run=/home/external-user/ssd/yongjae_refiner/ck/v4/train/v4M10_rng2
kd_calib.det=/PLACEHOLDER/v4_3/kd_calib_det.json
kd_calib.map=/PLACEHOLDER/v4_3/kd_calib_map.json
